# PREPARED, NEVER RUN. Production Mosquitto ACL.
#
# Same rule as development: a machine's broker username MUST equal its
# Machine.identifier, so the %u patterns pin every device to its own topic
# branch. A device can never read another machine's commands and can never
# publish outside its three own branches.
#
# Replace 3awedlou only if MQTT_PREFIX changes; the two must always agree.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- backend ----
# The Symfony publisher and app:mqtt:consume share this account. It is the only
# account with a wildcard grant.
user backend
topic readwrite 3awedlou/#

# --------------------------------------------------------------- machines ----
pattern write 3awedlou/machines/%u/telemetry
pattern write 3awedlou/machines/%u/status
pattern write 3awedlou/machines/%u/events
pattern read 3awedlou/machines/%u/commands
